{{ attach_library('srl_payment/srl_payment') }}
<section class="whiteSection sectionPadding white-sec-bg">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-md-10 messagesection text-center offset-md-1">
        <h3 class="sectionMessage text-orange mt-3  mb-4">Congratulations!</h3>
        <h5>
          Thank you for completing your Fast Track Application. 
        </h5>
        <h5>
         You have met the qualifications for admission and have been accepted into our Program. 
        </h5>
        <p>Our next Bootcamp begins on {{ page_html.next_updatedate|raw }} and scholarships are still available!.</p>
      

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="graySection sectionPadding enroll-txt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-images d-flex justify-content-center">
      <div class="circle_img circle_clr2 text-center">
        <img class="img-fluid" src="/themes/hilbert/images/enrollment_white.png" alt="">
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="enroll-section mt-3 text-center">
      <h4>What’s Next for You? </h4>
      {% if page_html.payment_type == 'Financing'%}
      <p>There are a variety of options available to help make financing your bootcamp as simple and attainable as possible, including scholarships, 0% financing loan options, and more. To ensure you are taking advantage of every benefit available, we highly recommend scheduling a brief call with a personal program consultant:</p>
      <a href="{{ page_html.chatbot_link|raw }}" target="_blank" id="finance_book" class="btn btn-schedule">BOOK AN APPOINTMENT NOW</a>
      </section>
     
     <section class="whiteSection sectionPadding enroll-txt">
     <div class="container">
      <div class="enroll-section mt-3 text-center">
    <h4 class="mt-4">Prefer to Proceed on Your Own?</h4>
      <p>While most learners prefer support from a program consultant, we understand that you may be interested in taking action immediately: </p>
      <div class="schlorship-main">
      <div class="schlorshipcontent mt-4">
      <h4 class"mt-4">Apply For Scholarships</h4> 
      <p>Applying for scholarships typically takes just a few minutes and successful completion guarantees awards that lower tuition costs to just $9,995 USD:  </p>
      <a href="{{ page_html.financing_scholarship_url|raw }}" id="see_qualify"  target="_blank" class="btn btn-schedule"> SEE IF YOU QUALIFY </a>
        <h4 class="mt-4">Apply For Full Financing  </h4> 
      <p>If you prefer to forego applying for scholarships, click the link below to explore direct financing for your bootcamp program.</p>
       <p> NOTE: If you intend to apply for scholarships in the future, you can input the pre-approved tuition price of $9,995 USD in the financing application: </p>
     
       </div>
       <div class="schlorshipcontent mt-4">
        {% else %}
       
    <p>We have assigned you a personal program consultant who will reach out to you shortly to assist you throughout the payment and enrollment process so be on the lookout for an introductory email to schedule a brief consultation.</p>
    <p>If you prefer to get started now, we have provided some quick links below. Students who pay in full are eligible to receive a ${{ page_html.update_discounted_amount|number_format|raw }} USD tuition discount, however we offer supplementary scholarship opportunities which can reduce the price of your bootcamp to as low as ${{ page_html.scholarships_amount|number_format|raw }} USD</p>
     </section>
     <section class="whiteSection sectionPadding enroll-txt">
     <div class="container">
      <div class="enroll-section mt-3 text-center">
      <div class="schlorship-main">
<div class="schlorshipcontent">
      <h4 class="mt-4">Apply For Scholarships </h4> 
      <p>Applying for scholarships typically takes just a few minutes and scholarship awards are gauranteed upon valid completion of the scholarship application:</p>
      <a href="{{ page_html.fullpay_scholarship_url|raw }}" id="see_qualify" target="_blank" class="btn btn-schedule"> SEE IF YOU QUALIFY </a>
       </div>
      <div class="schlorshipcontent"> 
        <h4 class="mt-4">Enroll Immediately </h4> 
         <p>If you prefer to forego applying for scholarships and move directly to enrollment, click the link below to pay up front now.  </p>
      
         {% endif %}
           <div class="button-sec d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center mt-3 mb-3">
      
           {{ page_html.proceed_payment_form|raw }}
      
     </div>
      {# {% if page_html.payment_type == 'Financing'%}
       <div class="schlorshipcontent"> 
 <div class="proceed-payment">
 <div class="container">     
      <div class="loan-option">
          <div class="option-3 btn-loan schedule-call"> 
         <h4>We’re Here to Help!</h4><p>If you still have questions about funding your bootcamp, scholarship options, or just general questions about the program itself, your personal program consultant is here to help! </p>
         <a class="btn btn-thanks button button--primary js-form-submit form-submit btn-credit" target="_blank" href="{{ page_html.chatbot_link|raw }}">BOOK AN APPOINTMENT NOW</a>
     </div>
        </div>
        </div>
        </div>
         </div>
        {% endif %} #}
    
    </div>
    </div>
    </div>
    
  </div>
   </div>
  </div>
 
</section>

<section class="orangeSection sectionPadding ">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-images d-flex justify-content-center">
      <div class="circle_img circle_clr2">
        <img class="img-fluid" src="/themes/hilbert/images/contact_white.png" alt="">
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="section-schedule text-center">
      <div class="text-section mt-3 mb-3">
      <h5>Most Learners Prefer to Speak With a Consultant </h5>
         {% if page_html.payment_type == 'Financing'%}
        <h3>As a bootcamp learner, you have access to a personal program consultant who is available to walk you through enrollment, provide scholarship or funding guidance and answer any remaining questions you have  about the program or alternative funding options.  </h3>
       {% else %}
       <h3>Your personal program consultant is available to walk you through enrollment, provide scholarship or funding guidance and answer any remaining questions you have. You can select a time to schedule a call with yours now.</h3>
    
      {% endif %}
      </div>
      <a href="{{ page_html.chatbot_link|raw }}" target="_blank" class="btn btn-schedule">BOOK AN APPOINTMENT NOW</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  </div>
</section>
